* Debye-Huckel test parameters
*

BONDS
QP   QN    100.0   3.80

ANGLES
QP   QN   QP    10.0   110.0
QN   QP   QN    10.0   110.0

DIHEDRALS
X    QP   QN   X     0.0   1     0.0   ! zero force, but dihedrals must exist for the 1-4 list

NONBONDED nbxmod 5 atom cdiel fshift vatom vdistance vfswitch -
  cutnb 20.0 ctofnb 18.0 ctonb 16.0 eps 1.0 e14fac 1.0 wmin 1.5
IP   0.0   -0.0    1.0     ! no LJ: pure electrostatics
IN   0.0   -0.0    1.0
QP   0.0   -0.1    2.0     ! nonzero eps so OpenMM keeps the 1-4 exceptions
QN   0.0   -0.1    2.0

END
